^##.......,,......W_______W..#^^
^#..===....,.t....W___B___W...^^
^#..=P=...........W_______W...^^
^#..===.....k.....WWWWDWWWW...^^
^#...................T........^^
^#....,,......................#^
^#...,h,,.....................#^
^##...,,............s.........#^
^^#.....................c....##^
^^##.........,,.............##^^
